*RESOURCES
SECURITY NONE
MASTER tuxapp
MODEL SHM
IPCKEY 32769

*MACHINES
"@UNAME@" LMID=tuxapp @TLOGDEV@ APPDIR="@CURDIR@" TUXCONFIG="@CURDIR@/tuxconfig" TUXDIR="@TUXDIR@"

*GROUPS
@GROUPLINE@
GROUP2 LMID=tuxapp GRPNO=2

*SERVERS
servera SRVGRP=GROUP1 SRVID=1 CLOPT="-A"
serverb SRVGRP=GROUP1 SRVID=2 CLOPT="-A"
serverc SRVGRP=GROUP2 SRVID=3 CLOPT="-A"
